  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commercial Reforestation on Lands Dedicated to Extensive Cattle Grazing in Magdalena Bajo Seco Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Magdalena Bajo Seco Project is to reduce emissions of Greenhouse Gases (GHG) through the reforestat ion and sustainable management of 3,137 ha of land traditionally devoted to extensive cattle grazing. The delivery of the ERs accord ing to the delivery schedule agreed upon in the Emission Reduction Purchase Agreement (ERPA) will be the results indicator that is g oing to be monitored by the World Bank over time.</narrative>
  </description>
